---
// Motif batik section, sumber Figma node 796:60. Reused di hero + ketiga
// halaman starterpack. batik-starterpack.png = raw tile TANPA opacity
// baked-in (beda sama public/images/elements/bgbatik.svg yang sudah
// fill-opacity="0.1" di dalam SVG-nya — jangan pakai itu di sini, dobel opacity).
---

<div
	class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-repeat opacity-15"
	style="background-image: url('/images/elements/batik-starterpack.png'); background-size: 360px auto;"
	aria-hidden="true"
></div>
